5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have no information yet, I suggest we spend this time observing each other's communication styles. Let's keep the atmosphere calm.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm so excited! I'll do my best to help everyone find the werewolf! Let's all be honest and friendly with each other!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. Logic and observation are our best tools. I'll be looking for any inconsistencies in how people present themselves.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,A cautious approach is best. I will be analyzing the flow of the conversation to see if anyone is trying to steer the narrative too early.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, this is like a big mystery game! I'm going to use my detective skills to find the wolf! Let's have fun, everyone!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, @Sakura, your energy is welcome, but remember that the werewolf may use a friendly persona to blend in.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, you're right! I'll be careful, but I still think being nice helps us trust each other!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Trust is a luxury we cannot afford yet. I'm interested to see who agrees with whom too quickly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Exactly. Mirroring others is a common tactic for the Possessed or the Werewolf. I'll be watching for those echoes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! But I'll be super careful, I promise! I wonder who the Seer is?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,The Seer should remain hidden for now to avoid becoming an immediate target. It is the most rational strategy.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Kenji,,That makes sense! We have to protect the Seer like a secret treasure!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I concur. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, we lose our only source of objective truth.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. For now, we should simply establish a baseline of behavior for everyone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, a secret treasure! I'll help protect them! Hehe!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
